    <h1 class="as-title">Materials Studio在Slurm系统上提交教程<span class="as-rating" style="--rating: 4.8;" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"></span></h1>
  </header>

    <p class="as-subtitle">在Slurm系统上提交Materials Studio任务</p>

    <i class="as-subtitle">所有代码仅供参考


    <h2>提交代码如下</h2>
    <h3><a href="https://websiteanthony.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/rlzhao/media/pages/articles/20230503/sub.sh">sub.sh</a></h3>
    <pre><code class="language-bash">
      #!/bin/bash


      #SBATCH --job-name=***
      #SBATCH -p part*
      #SBATCH -n 50


      cd /home/**** #任务提交位置
      cat /proc/cpuinfo > cpuinfo.log
      export PATH=/home/dftuser/BIOVIA/MaterialsStudio20.1/etc/CASTEP/bin/:$PATH #Materials Studio CASTEP的PATH位置
      RunCASTEP.sh -np 50 GBP

    </code></pre>

    <h3>把sub.sh放入提交目录文件夹</h3>
    <pre><code class="language-python">
     sbatch sub.sh #提交任务
    </code></pre>

    <h3>查看任务的两种方式</h3>
    <pre><code class="language-python">
      scontrol show job ID  #方式1
      squeue #方式1
    </code></pre>

